bounty_h.Rewards_Info:
{~r}Bounty Rewards System:{~}

Each bounty creature is worth a certain amount of gold. Return to Janice to hand in your kills; the gold is paid immediately. The first successful hand-in by each player per week can also award bounty tokens. Stored tokens are kept until you exchange them and belong to that player.

When exchanging one token, choose a reward profile to influence which type of reward you receive. An active hero must be visiting the town.

