bounty_h.Token_Exchange_Info:
{Bounty Token Exchange}

Exchange one stored bounty token at a time. Choose a profile to influence the reward category. The exact reward within that category is selected randomly. Supplies favors resources, Treasure Hunt favors artifacts, and Training and Knowledge favors primary skills, experience and spells. ACM Rewards is available only while the Advanced Classes Mod is active.

An active hero must be visiting the town to receive the reward.

